!! to (TO)



!!! Definition

;__to__ (TO): Indicates the start of a parenthetical remark which must be grammatical Lojban text.



!!! See Also

* {toi}



!!! Keywords

start parenthesis



!!! Examples

 .i ba bo lo fengu voksa to be la ractu toi co'e lu ju'i .pat. ju'i .pat. do ma zvati li'u%%%

''Next came an angry voice--the Rabbit's--'Pat! Pat! Where are you?' ''

{BOX}



{BOX()}

!! to'i (TO)



!!! Definition

;__to'i__ (TO): Indicates the start of an editorial remark which must be grammatical Lojban text. Equivalent to {to sa'a}.



!!! See Also

* {to}

* {toi}

* {sa'a}



!!! Keywords

editorial unquote



!!! Examples

;lu .ei do ckeji sei la .alis. cusku .i do barda nixli to'i ju'o drani toi .i .i'e nai ca'o tai klaku .i .e'i ko ca sisti li'u:'' 'You ought to be ashamed of yourself,' said Alice, 'a great girl like you,' (she might well say this), 'to go on crying in this way! Stop this moment, I tell you!' ''

{BOX}



{BOX()}

!! toi (TOI)



!!! Definition

;__toi__ (TOI): Terminator for TO. Used to end an parenthetical or editorial remark.



!!! See Also

* {to}

* {to'i}



!!! Keywords

end parenthesis



